     "transcript": [
      {
       "start": 0.0,
       "end": 5.0,
       "text": "A wedding seating plan: three tables, thirty guests.",
       "sceneId": "h-seat"
      },
      {
       "start": 5.0,
       "end": 8.6,
       "text": "Who sits with whom?",
       "sceneId": "h-seat"
      },
      {
       "start": 10.75,
       "end": 16.35,
       "text": "Friends together, strangers apart: you are already clustering.",
       "sceneId": "h-seat2"
      },
      {
       "start": 17.41,
       "end": 24.01,
       "text": "Clustering: what is tightly linked goes in one group, with few links between groups.",
       "sceneId": "h-what"
      },
      {
       "start": 24.01,
       "end": 29.41,
       "text": "You need not know who anyone is, only who is linked to whom.",
       "sceneId": "h-what"
      },
      {
       "start": 37.0,
       "end": 42.022,
       "text": "On a chip, millions of cells are wired into one network.",
       "sceneId": "h-chip"
      },
      {
       "start": 42.022,
       "end": 46.689,
       "text": "Cells in one group sit together, so their wires are short;",
       "sceneId": "h-chip"
      },
      {
       "start": 46.689,
       "end": 51.089,
       "text": "wires between groups are long, slow and costly.",
       "sceneId": "h-chip"
      },
      {
       "start": 51.18,
       "end": 55.98,
       "text": "The course's five friends: thicker line, closer friends.",
       "sceneId": "h-friends"
      },
      {
       "start": 55.98,
       "end": 60.38,
       "text": "Split them in two; the friendship cut is the cut.",
       "sceneId": "h-friends"
      },
      {
       "start": 63.15,
       "end": 68.839,
       "text": "ABC | DE cuts only 3; AE | BCD cuts 12.",
       "sceneId": "h-count"
      },
      {
       "start": 68.839,
       "end": 74.083,
       "text": "Five people into two groups: 15 ways, easy to try them all.",
       "sceneId": "h-count"
      },
      {
       "start": 74.083,
       "end": 78.683,
       "text": "A hundred people? The count has 30 digits.",
       "sceneId": "h-count"
      },
      {
       "start": 80.16,
       "end": 85.16,
       "text": "Trying them one by one never ends. So we need algorithms.",
       "sceneId": "h-algos"
      },
      {
       "start": 85.16,
       "end": 90.16,
       "text": "This course's eight modules are eight answers.",
       "sceneId": "h-algos"
      },
      {
       "start": 90.16,
       "end": 95.16,
       "text": "They fall into a few families.",
       "sceneId": "h-algos"
      },
      {
       "start": 102.5,
       "end": 110.189,
       "text": "First: score every pair, then merge the closest, pair by pair (M02–M04).",
       "sceneId": "h-families"
      },
      {
       "start": 110.189,
       "end": 117.878,
       "text": "Second: let groups emerge, by label propagation or spectral methods (M05–M06).",
       "sceneId": "h-families"
      },
      {
       "start": 119.27,
       "end": 126.67,
       "text": "Third: improve a grouping by swapping pairs or moving one at a time (M07–M08).",
       "sceneId": "h-improve"
      },
      {
       "start": 126.67,
       "end": 133.248,
       "text": "The last module aims for speed: make the slowest path fast (M09).",
       "sceneId": "h-improve"
      },
      {
       "start": 134.16,
       "end": 139.56,
       "text": "Eight modules, one problem.",
       "sceneId": "h-route"
      },
      {
       "start": 141.5,
       "end": 147.5,
       "text": "Clustering is not one algorithm but one question:",
       "sceneId": "h-outro"
      },
      {
       "start": 147.5,
       "end": 154.5,
       "text": "how do we group things so the links stay inside?",
       "sceneId": "h-outro"
      },
      {
       "start": 154.5,
       "end": 160.5,
       "text": "Each module gives one answer.",
       "sceneId": "h-outro"
      },
      {
       "start": 160.5,
       "end": 167.5,
       "text": "It starts with scoring a pair.",
       "sceneId": "h-outro"
      },
      {
       "start": 170.6,
       "end": 176.6,
       "text": "Start with Module 02.",
       "sceneId": "h-end"
      }
     ],
